{"reference":"Ezekiel 25","book":"Ezekiel","chapter":25,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"Reading Ezekiel 25","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Ezekiel 25 can be read as the opening of the larger 25–32 section. A practical outline also recognizes 1–3, 4–24, 33–39, and 40–48 as major reading divisions, while leaving questions of chronology or composition unsettled.","verse_refs":["Ezekiel 25:1-17"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_ezekiel_025_32aec32cc1805dd48ad5ca83"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}